text = "KEYBINDINGS:
• WASD: Character & Vehicle Movement
• Space: Jump / Handbrake
• Shift: Sprint / Boost
• E: Interact (Doors, Vendors, ATMs, Vehicles)
• I / Tab: Inventory Backpack
• M: World Navigation Map
• J: Mission Log & Objectives
• H: Vehicle Horn  |  L: Vehicle Headlights  |  R: Radio Station
• ESC: Pause Menu  |  F3: Performance Profiler"

